('Alag Horizon', 'alag-group-horizon', 'MG Road, Ghatkopar East', '₹ 2.15 Cr', 'upcoming', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600596542815-ffad4c1539a9?w=1200&q=80', '2 & 3 BHK', 'Oct 2025', 'P51800000007', 'Residential', 'Panoramic City Views', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154340-be6161a56a0c?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512917774080-9991f1c4c750?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607687920-4e2a09cf159d?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1613490900233-141c5560d75d?w=1200&q=80"]', '["Rooftop Deck", "Barbeque Area", "Automated Parking", "Premium Bath Fittings"]', '["Deck", "Parking", "Security"]', 'Alag Horizon redefines the skyline of Ghatkopar East. With expansive decks offering panoramic city views and world-class fittings, it is designed for those who appreciate the finer things in life.', true),
('Drushti Sapphire', 'drushti-sapphire', 'Ghatkopar East, Mumbai', '₹ 1.80 Cr', 'ready-to-move', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1564013799919-ab600027ffc6?w=1200&q=80', '2 & 3 BHK', 'Ready to Move', 'P51800000008', 'Residential', 'Vibrant Community Living', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185007-cde436f6a4d0?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583847268964-b28dc8f51f92?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600573472591-ee6b68d14c68?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1598928506311-c55dd1b31043?w=1200&q=80"]', '["Community Hall", "Yoga & Meditation Zone", "Landscaped Gardens", "24/7 Power Backup"]', '["Yoga", "Hall", "Garden"]', 'Drushti Sapphire offers meticulously crafted homes with a focus on natural light and ventilation. It is a vibrant community located in the cultural heart of Ghatkopar.', true),
('Gurukrupa Marina', 'gurukrupa-marina', 'Ghatkopar East, Mumbai', '₹ 2.40 Cr', 'ultra-luxury', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616137466211-f939a420be84?w=1200&q=80', '3 & 4 BHK', 'Q4 2026', 'P51800000009', 'Residential', 'Majestic Clubhouse Living', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502005229762-cf1b2da7c5d6?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522708323590-d24dbb6b0267?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618219908412-a29a1bb7b86e?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1502672260266-1c1de2d96674?w=1200&q=80"]', '["Grand Clubhouse", "Swimming Pool", "Jogging Track", "Co-working Space"]', '["Pool", "Jogging Track", "Clubhouse"]', 'Gurukrupa Marina offers vast open spaces, exceptional privacy, and a majestic clubhouse. A perfect sanctuary for your family in a bustling city.', true),
('Adityaraj Signature', 'adityaraj-signature', 'Pant Nagar, Ghatkopar East', '₹ 1.45 Cr', 'premium', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599423300746-b62533397364?w=1200&q=80', '1 & 2 BHK', 'Dec 2025', 'P51800000010', 'Residential', 'Efficient Premium Layouts', '["https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600210491892-03d54c0aaf87?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600607688969-a5bfcd64bd40?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600566753376-12c8ab7fb75b?w=1200&q=80", "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1600585154363-67eb9e2e2099?w=1200&q=80"]', '["Fitness Center", "Indoor Games", "Rooftop Garden", "Reticulated Gas System"]', '["Gym", "Garden", "Games"]', 'Adityaraj Signature provides an excellent entry point into the premium Ghatkopar East market. Efficient layouts, superb build quality, and unmatched accessibility.', true);
